              <ul class="ms-stories">
                
                <li class="ms-story ms-story--insight">
                  <span class="ms-story-tag">Match &middot; insight</span>
                  <p class="ms-story-text">Volos feels they have not received the results they deserved in recent matches and must focus on upcoming games.</p>
                  <span class="ms-story-meta">Preview insight about Volos&#x27; recent results and focus</span>
                  
                </li>
                
                <li class="ms-story ms-story--insight">
                  <span class="ms-story-tag">Match &middot; insight</span>
                  <p class="ms-story-text">The match is competitive with Volos showing resilience to come back from behind, but also under pressure to improve effectiveness and avoid self-inflicted setbacks.</p>
                  <span class="ms-story-meta">Preview insight about Volos&#x27; resilience and pressure to improve effectiveness</span>
                  
                </li>
                
                <li class="ms-story ms-story--insight">
                  <span class="ms-story-tag">Home &middot; insight</span>
                  <p class="ms-story-text">Olympiacos owner Vangelis Marinakis confirmed the club will cover the entire cost of the new Karaiskakis stadium construction, estimated at 250 million euros, without state funding. The project dossier has been approved by the Ministry of Environment, pending legislative changes for the metal roof height and a 49-year stadium usage extension. The Hellenic Olympic Committee supports the plan and will sign a lease contract with Olympiacos. Construction is planned to start in May 2027.</p>
                  <span class="ms-story-meta">Olympiacos Piraeus new Karaiskakis stadium project update</span>
                  
                </li>
                
              </ul>
              
              <p class="ms-stories-more"><span style="color:#EB2564;">15+ More Live Insights &amp; Quotes</span> Available For This Game.</p>
              
