            <section class="ms-pane ms-pane--pred">
              <div class="ms-pane-head">
                <span class="ms-pane-title">Prediction</span>
                <span class="ms-pane-note">1X2</span>
              </div>
              <div class="ms-pred-pick">
                <div>
                  <span class="ms-pred-label">Model pick</span>
                  <div class="ms-pred-choice">Home win</div>
                </div>
                
              </div>
              <p class="ms-pred-why">Olympiacos Piraeus has a dominant historical head-to-head record against Volos, winning all 14 of their previous encounters with 45 goals scored and only 6 conceded. Olympiacos is in strong form, having won their recent Greek Cup match 4-0 and maintaining a solid defensive record. Despite two Olympiacos players being injured, their squad depth and home advantage at the Karaiskakis Stadium favor them. Volos has shown resilience and tactical adjustments but struggles to create significant chances and has yet to secure a league win this season. Market odds also strongly favor Olympiacos, reinforcing the expectation of a home victory.</p>
            </section>

